BT 1 0 0 1 0 47.5 Tm /F2 10.5 Tf 14.5 TL 1.737685 Tw (For the Enterprise Job Application Management System, a low-code platform can be used effectively to) Tj T* 0 Tw .571537 Tw (develop the standard parts of the system rapidly: forms for job applications and applicant details, reports on) Tj T* 0 Tw 3.986099 Tw (application history, workflows for application processing and HR approval, notifications, and basic) Tj T* 0 Tw (dashboards. These features correspond to the capabilities that low-code platforms are designed to provide.) Tj T* ET
