BT 1 0 0 1 0 105.5 Tm /F2 10.5 Tf 14.5 TL 2.791315 Tw (As the organisation grows, the requirements become more demanding. A large number of applicants,) Tj T* 0 Tw .754008 Tw (applications and records raises performance and data-management concerns; integration with CRM, HRMS) Tj T* 0 Tw .145539 Tw (and job portals raises integration concerns; differing access needs and the handling of applicant personal data) Tj T* 0 Tw .012685 Tw (raise security and governance concerns; and advanced features such as intelligent resume screening may need) Tj T* 0 Tw .007639 Tw (external services. In such cases, extensions, integrations or custom development may be needed in addition to) Tj T* 0 Tw .156549 Tw (the low-code application. Low-code is therefore useful for rapidly developing standard business applications,) Tj T* 0 Tw .281935 Tw (whereas increasingly complex enterprise requirements may call for a hybrid approach, and the choice should) Tj T* 0 Tw (be based on the requirements of the application.) Tj T* ET
